  type_record_ext_err_create.pcpp - break step of type_record_ext.pcpp:
  create takes a pointer to a record or an overlay, not a ptr to int32 (SM0409)

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\type_record_ext_err_create.pcpp
